    <data key="d0">Accenture Circulus Supply Chain Solution</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5CwIt-Alqhg</data>
    <data key="d2">Accenture's Circulus Supply Chain solution uses IoT sensors, AWS Lambda, Hyperledger Fabric on EKS, DynamoDB off-chain storage, S3 data lake, and SageMaker predictive models to improve coffee supply chain transparency and farmer incentives.</data>
